      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T19:53:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "jrn@ - is reading the .repo/manifests/default.xml file the correct way to capture metrics about the current Android branch that the user is working on?",
      "revId": "232c7601633d547e0885ac8c85ce308d78853951",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "01ae613e_06626dd8",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1074628
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T20:26:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Beyond the issues we\u0027re discussing in the other comment, this doesn\u0027t tell you which branch the user checked out -- only information about the remotes/defaults, which doesn\u0027t necessarily match (example: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/manifest/+/build-tools/default.xml )",
      "parentUuid": "01334c03_dd039588",
      "revId": "232c7601633d547e0885ac8c85ce308d78853951",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "67188a76_08438cf3",
        "filename": "cmd/soong_ui/main.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 225,
